WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Press Start. The guide takes about 2 to 5 minutes.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.500
Step 1: turn the body if the sore side isn't facing you.

00:05.500 --> 00:12.000
Step 2: choose Draw, then mark every area that hurts.

00:12.000 --> 00:27.000
Choose Turn and drag to spin the body, so you can reach the painful area.

00:27.000 --> 00:36.000
Draw over the pain. A line can show pain that travels.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.500
Next come a few quick safety questions.

00:40.500 --> 00:47.000
Mark every painful area, then press Continue to answer a few short questions.
